OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fahead with plenty of clear spells.
OL,7,FTemperatures will fall sharply
OL,8,Fovernight, beneath the long clear
OL,9,Fspells with easing winds, so a
OL,10,Fwidespread frost is likely.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cold start, but dry and
OL,13,Fsunny throughout the day. Another cold
OL,14,Fday, with temperatures a few degrees
OL,15,Fbelow average for the time of year,
OL,16,Fbut only a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
