OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Ffrosty start, then bright and dry on
OL,7,FSaturday. Cloudier with showery spells
OL,8,Fon Sunday. Becoming brighter on
OL,9,FMonday, though with some patches of
OL,10,Flight rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
